### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@predit.com.br",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customers ordered by risk
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Critical customers only
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers?riskLevel=CRITICAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customers filtered like the dashboard
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers?dealership=Ford%20Lapa&query=Ana
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a new model inference for Ana's Ranger
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vehicles/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1/risk-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 86,
  "reasons": "Revisao atrasada; garantia proxima do fim; queda de engajamento",
  "recommendedAction": "Contato consultivo em ate 24 horas",
  "modelName": "predit-retention-model",
  "modelVersion": "1.1.0"
}

### Proactive leads
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a lead status
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/v1/leads/e1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONTACTED",
  "assignedTo": "admin@predit.com.br"
}

### Campaigns used by the dashboard
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate consent-based campaign
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/v1/campaigns/f1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Risk assessment history for Ana's Ranger
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vehicles/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1/risk-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single campaign (target of the Location header)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/campaigns/f1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Business rule: lead for customer without consent -> 422
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "vehicleId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa5",
  "title": "Revisao atrasada",
  "action": "Ligar para o cliente",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Error: vehicle of another customer -> 404
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/customers/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vehicles/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaa2/risk-assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 50,
  "reasons": "Teste",
  "recommendedAction": "Teste",
  "modelName": "predit-retention-model",
  "modelVersion": "1.1.0"
}

### Error: malformed JSON -> 400 problem+json
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ bad json

### Error: unsupported method -> 405
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error: no token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/dashboard/summary
